aced in place the next time install runs — a hand-written entry naming a different, customized target is left untouched. Windows also repairs the POSIX installer\'s active shell-form hook entries to exec form in place, and moves its verifier from `Bash` to `Bash\\|PowerShell` without duplicating one already there.': 0 matches
